The shopkeeper looks at his tablet.
He opens a registration form.
He asks, "Madam, what is your name?"
I say, "My name is Maya."
The shopkeeper asks, "What ID card do you have?"
I say, "I have a passport."
I show my passport.
He looks at it.
He asks, "What is your country?"
I say, "I am from Mexico."
The shopkeeper writes that on the tablet.
He asks again, "What is your age?"
I say, "My age is thirty-one years."
He asks, "Thirty-one?"
I say, "Yes, thirty-one years."
The shopkeeper types everything into the registration form.
He says, "The registration is complete."
